  "limitations": [
    "This is a tested addition to selected provider families; it does not implement every API or concrete donor class.",
    "No claim of complete M3JDK image, OpenJDK jtreg/HotSpot, full repository reactor or receiving-phase promotion.",
    "All32 application flag bits, existing-slot flags, Java and checked JNI masks are covered. Snapshot selection allocates metadata and result references.",
    "Provider facade serialization and concurrent shared-owner use are not qualified. Immutable/primitive/sorted/grouping donor results can retain donor storage.",
    "Eclipse bag intentionally rejects per-key integer overflow and preserves correct occurrence removal instead of reproducing two pinned donor defects.",
    "Both bimap collectors reject duplicate keys or values, including cross-partition conflicts. Apache put displacement remains available after collection.",
    "The exact diagnostic does not support a universal speed or fresh-construction memory advantage. Existing-key count updates allocated0bytes for M3 and all3donor count baselines.",
    "Complete source clones are retained with shallow history. Runtime dependencies remain pinned Maven artifacts; whole-ecosystem offline source vendoring is not complete."
  ],
  "source_reconciliation_notes": [
    "Preserved new baseline Guava filters, Apache predicates, SDK families,32bit mask APIs and ObjectStateSlots28 extension methods.",
    "Added only two explicit empty public constructors to fix new baseline exported-class compiler warnings.",
    "Corrected4 wrong baseline test oracles using actual JDK/reference behavior without modifying production tree/filter algorithms.",
    "Preserved all historical source receipts and added exact frozen-base plus six-file successor admission."
  ]
}
